        "name": "ACA Premium Tax Credit",
        "description": "The Premium Tax Credit (PTC) can help pay for a health plan through the federal Marketplace. It can lower your monthly insurance bill. The amount depends on your household and expected income for the year.\n\nYou can use all, some, or none of the credit each month. MyFriendBen shows an estimate of the premium tax credit you may qualify for. Your actual savings may be lower based on the plan you choose. The credit lowers your monthly premium, and you pay the rest.\n\nHealth coverage through your job or a family member's job may affect whether you qualify for the credit. The Marketplace will ask about job-based coverage when you apply.\n\nSelect \"Apply Now\" to create an account and apply for coverage through HealthCare.gov.",
